      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_select_02",
      "hash64": "1D7146A7871682F4",
      "text": "你怎麼會在這裡！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_02",
      "hash64": "45295B139DA136BE",
      "text": "嘿嘿……我是來看看\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳過得好不好的喔～！\\r\\n畢竟我是[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的班導師嘛～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
