        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_06",
      "hash64": "45295F139DA13D8A",
      "text": "對了！\\n就讓我用野餐當作賠禮吧～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_07",
      "hash64": "452960139DA13F3D",
      "text": "我早就料到可能會發生這種事，\\n所以事先跟克拉韋爾校長\\r\\n借了桌子之類的東西喔～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
