      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_14",
      "hash64": "452CE3139DA453AD",
      "text": "寶可夢的蛋\\n從野餐籃中登場了～！[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_15",
      "hash64": "452CE2139DA451FA",
      "text": "明明只有溶食獸在，\\n野餐籃裡怎麼會有蛋呢？好神奇喔～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
