      "text": "話說，[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳在這裡也有\\n好好使用寶可夢圖鑑App嗎～？[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
